---
title: "join (Sui Framework: balance)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: Balance(value) destructured from input
    q_destruct --> q_update: self.value = self.value + value
    q_update --> [*]: return self.value

    note right of q_update
        INV-001: total balance after join equals sum of both balances
        INV-002: input balance is consumed (destroyed)
        INV-003: no overflow check - caller must ensure self.value + value <= U64_MAX
    end note
